  },

  { id: "3", label: "", title: "Warehousing & Distribution", description: `MAS warehousing services are specifically designed for your requirement; gives flexibility and scalability to cater to your business growth and overall needs. Enhanced customer experience, reduced cost of operation, efficient processes and Short lead time are some of the benefits of opting for dedicated warehouse.

